                                "text": "[…] “His wife was a roundheels anyway—”\n“Darling.” She took him by the braid-edged lapels. “Won’t you watch your language a little for the duration? I know Grannie’s horrified sometimes.”\n“Grannie wouldn’t know what a roundheels means,” Bruno said hoarsely."
